* ============================================================================
* 12_table3_mechanism.do — Token/Hidden/Subst mechanism (benefit_society)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* Methodology: Distel-Grimpe-Poetz (2026, Research Policy §3.2.1) —
*   Token (symbolic adoption) vs Hidden (substantive adoption) decoupling.
*   Westphal & Zajac (2001, ASQ) institutional theory base.
*
* M1: Token → short-term reaction (use ROBUSTNESS_DV = CAR)
* M2: Hidden → long-term fundamentals (use MAIN_DV = ROA)
* M3: Substantive (alignment) → fundamentals
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

* M1: Token → CAR (short-term market reaction)
capture confirm variable {{ROBUSTNESS_DV}}
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{ROBUSTNESS_DV}} {{MECHANISM_TOKEN}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo M1_token_CAR
}

* M2: Hidden → ROA (long-term fundamentals)
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{MECHANISM_HIDDEN}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M2_hidden_ROA

* M3: Substantive (consistency between token and hidden) → ROA
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{MECHANISM_SUBST}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M3_subst_ROA

* M4: Joint Token + Hidden + Subst
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{MECHANISM_TOKEN}} {{MECHANISM_HIDDEN}} {{MECHANISM_SUBST}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo M4_joint

esttab M1_token_CAR M2_hidden_ROA M3_subst_ROA M4_joint ///
    using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Mechanism --- Token vs Hidden Adoption (Distel 2026 + Westphal-Zajac 2001)") ///
    mtitles("Token→CAR" "Hidden→ROA" "Subst→ROA" "Joint") ///
    addnotes("Bank/year FE; SE clustered at {{CLUSTER_VAR}}.")

display "[OK] Table 3 → $tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex"
